    "Var(Delta) is compared to a *measured* noise floor, not to zero. A Delta that looks large can be entirely replicate disagreement: Ru sigma = 0.22 log on its own.",
    "The noise floor comes from 309 replicate groups and is itself uncertain; the interaction share inherits that uncertainty, which is why every pair carries a clustered bootstrap CI.",
    "Phototoxicity has no cross-metal matched unit (MSRS-0), so its interaction is not estimable at all and its entry is INSUFFICIENT by construction, not by low power."
